    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Traverse the dark fantasy world of Tilsa</h2>Journey through Tilsa as Zafira, a respected scholar branded an outcast after her controversial findings. Gather ancient artifacts and tomes throughout your adventure, each one unlocking fragments of Tilsa's intricate and captivating past.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519790/extras/2e45923a1187b0a10c5a899a37339841.poster.avif?t=1722133974\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519790/extras/2e45923a1187b0a10c5a899a37339841.webm?t=1722133974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519790/extras/2e45923a1187b0a10c5a899a37339841.mp4?t=1722133974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Confront the Drothar in strategic melee combat</h2>Stand against the relentless onslaught of invading Drothar. Confront diverse groups of enemies, requiring you to adapt and evolve your combat strategy. Each encounter is a test of skill, presenting unique challenges that continuously test your aptitude in battle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519790/extras/c3dbf116f75ba5a2266dc1a438e8c57e.poster.avif?t=1722133974\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519790/extras/c3dbf116f75ba5a2266dc1a438e8c57e.webm?t=1722133974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519790/extras/c3dbf116f75ba5a2266dc1a438e8c57e.mp4?t=1722133974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Balance the power and price of channeling spells</h2>Channel powerful spells to shift the tides in your favor \u2013 but be warned, such power comes with a price. Offensive and defensive magic is your ally in battle and a resource on your journey. Use it wisely to manipulate your environment and overcome obstacles in your path.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519790/extras/c4b8b3f5aea877db898dee06c034f950.poster.avif?t=1722133974\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519790/extras/c4b8b3f5aea877db898dee06c034f950.webm?t=1722133974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519790/extras/c4b8b3f5aea877db898dee06c034f950.mp4?t=1722133974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shape your fate with strategic choices</h2>The decisions you make hold the power to transform your gameplay experience. With dynamic difficulty adjustments, the choices you make directly shape the challenges and narrative that await you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519790/extras/9534b4d7191d61377c007b70c7f32ef7.poster.avif?t=1722133974\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519790/extras/9534b4d7191d61377c007b70c7f32ef7.webm?t=1722133974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519790/extras/9534b4d7191d61377c007b70c7f32ef7.mp4?t=1722133974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Traverse the dark fantasy world of Tilsa</h2>Journey through Tilsa as Zafira, a respected scholar branded an outcast after her controversial findings. Gather ancient artifacts and tomes throughout your adventure, each one unlocking fragments of Tilsa's intricate and captivating past.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519790/extras/2e45923a1187b0a10c5a899a37339841.poster.avif?t=1722133974\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519790/extras/2e45923a1187b0a10c5a899a37339841.webm?t=1722133974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519790/extras/2e45923a1187b0a10c5a899a37339841.mp4?t=1722133974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Confront the Drothar in strategic melee combat</h2>Stand against the relentless onslaught of invading Drothar. Confront diverse groups of enemies, requiring you to adapt and evolve your combat strategy. Each encounter is a test of skill, presenting unique challenges that continuously test your aptitude in battle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519790/extras/c3dbf116f75ba5a2266dc1a438e8c57e.poster.avif?t=1722133974\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519790/extras/c3dbf116f75ba5a2266dc1a438e8c57e.webm?t=1722133974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519790/extras/c3dbf116f75ba5a2266dc1a438e8c57e.mp4?t=1722133974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Balance the power and price of channeling spells</h2>Channel powerful spells to shift the tides in your favor \u2013 but be warned, such power comes with a price. Offensive and defensive magic is your ally in battle and a resource on your journey. Use it wisely to manipulate your environment and overcome obstacles in your path.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519790/extras/c4b8b3f5aea877db898dee06c034f950.poster.avif?t=1722133974\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519790/extras/c4b8b3f5aea877db898dee06c034f950.webm?t=1722133974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519790/extras/c4b8b3f5aea877db898dee06c034f950.mp4?t=1722133974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shape your fate with strategic choices</h2>The decisions you make hold the power to transform your gameplay experience. With dynamic difficulty adjustments, the choices you make directly shape the challenges and narrative that await you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519790/extras/9534b4d7191d61377c007b70c7f32ef7.poster.avif?t=1722133974\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519790/extras/9534b4d7191d61377c007b70c7f32ef7.webm?t=1722133974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519790/extras/9534b4d7191d61377c007b70c7f32ef7.mp4?t=1722133974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
